# DodoRouter

> DodoRouter is an OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible LLM proxy with automatic provider fallback. Point any client at it once; it retries the next configured provider automatically on rate limits, outages, or context overflows, converts the response back to your client's format, and logs every request.

